"type": "rectangle", "x": 400, "y": 90, "width": 780, "height": 480, "backgroundColor": "#e3fafc", "strokeColor": "#0b7285", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 0}, {"type": "text", "x": 420, "y": 100, "text": "แมปกับบทบาทใน Scrum / ทีมจริง", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "strokeColor": "#0b7285"}, {"id": "po", "type": "rectangle", "x": 420, "y": 140, "width": 360, "height": 80, "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "strokeColor": "#e8590c", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "fontSize": 13, "text": "Product Owner → Admin หรือ Member\nดูแล backlog · ลำดับความสำคัญ · รับงานจาก Intake"}, {"id": "sm", "type": "rectangle", "x": 420, "y": 240, "width": 360, "height": 80, "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "strokeColor": "#c92a2a", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "fontSize": 13, "text": "Scrum Master → Admin\nตั้ง Cycle · states · estimates · เชิญคน"}, {"id": "dev", "type": "rectangle", "x": 420, "y": 340, "width": 360, "height": 80, "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "strokeColor": "#1864ab", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "fontSize": 13, "text": "Developers → Member\nขยับการ์ด · comment · ปิดงาน · sub-work items"}, {"id": "stk", "type": "rectangle", "x": 420, "y": 440, "width": 360, "height": 80, "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "strokeColor": "#5b6b7f", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "fontSize": 13, "text": "ผู้มีส่วนได้เสีย / ลูกค้า → Guest หรือ Sites\nดูบอร์ดสาธารณะ · โหวต · comment"}, {"id": "ethic", "type": "rectangle", "x": 800, "y": 140, "width": 360, "height": 380, "backgroundColor": "#f3f0ff", "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "roughness": 0, "fontFamily": "helvetica", "fontSize": 13, "text": "มุมจรรยาบรรณ\n\n• สิทธิ์เท่าที่จำเป็น (least privilege)\n  → หลักการ Management/Product\n\n• Activity log บันทึกว่าใครแก้อะไร\n  → ความรับผิดชอบตรวจสอบได้\n\n• Guest เห็นเฉพาะที่ควรเห็น\n  → รักษาความลับของลูกค้า\n\n• API token ผูกกับคนและหมดอายุได้\n  → ไม่แชร์รหัสกัน ไม่ใส่ในโค้ด"}]